{"t":"MCD","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"McDonald's Corporation","ko":"맥도날드","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Restaurants","employees":150000,"hq":"Chicago, IL, United States","website":"https://www.mcdonalds.com","summary_en":"McDonald's Corporation owns, operates, and franchises restaurants under the McDonald's brand in the United States and internationally. It offers food and beverages, including hamburgers and cheeseburgers, various chicken sandwiches, fries, shakes, frozen desserts, sundaes, soft serve cones, cookies, pies, soft drinks, coffee, and other beverages; and full or limited breakfast, as well as sells various other products during limited-time promotions. The company owns and operates franchised restaurants under various structures, including conventional franchise, developmental license, or affiliate. McDonald's Corporation was founded in 1940 and is based in Chicago, Illinois.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"McDonald's Corporation은 미국 및 전 세계에서 McDonald's 브랜드로 레스토랑을 소유, 운영 및 프랜차이즈하고 있습니다. 햄버거와 치즈버거, 다양한 치킨 샌드위치, 감자 튀김, 쉐이크, 냉동 디저트, 선데이, 소프트 아이스크림 콘, 쿠키, 파이, 청량 음료, 커피 및 기타 음료를 포함한 음식과 음료를 제공합니다. 조식 정식 또는 한정식을 제공하며, 기간 한정 프로모션 기간 동안 다양한 상품도 판매합니다. 이 회사는 기존 프랜차이즈, 개발 라이센스 또는 계열사를 포함한 다양한 구조로 프랜차이즈 레스토랑을 소유하고 운영합니다. McDonald's Corporation은 1940년에 설립되었으며 일리노이주 시카고에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":278.04,"mcap":196752654336.0,"pe":21.996836,"fpe":20.251638,"peg":2.9665,"ps":7.082019,"pb":-110.37714,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":2.78,"beta":null,"hi52":341.75,"lo52":229.2},"fin":{"rev":27782000640.0,"rev_g":0.011,"eps_g":0.104,"gross":0.5762,"op":0.50231,"net":0.32377,"roe":null,"fcf":null,"cash":null,"debt":null,"de":null,"eps":12.64,"feps":13.72926},"own":{"short":0.0212,"inst":0.76385003,"insider":0.0025600002},"analyst":{"n":28,"mean":291.75,"median":294.0,"high":390.0,"low":230.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.06061,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":15,"hold":14,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy"